Backport of the test fixes from upstream commit 56ff2910
("build(deps): upgrade to Go 1.27", #5681):
https://github.com/kopia/kopia/commit/56ff2910627073e25392026720ee996b0766a088

Go 1.27 changed the compress/flate output and the fmt output of a nil
json.RawMessage, breaking hard-coded test expectations.

diff -ruN a/repo/content/content_manager_test.go b/repo/content/content_manager_test.go
--- a/repo/content/content_manager_test.go
+++ b/repo/content/content_manager_test.go
@@ -2095,7 +2095,7 @@
 	require.NoError(t, err)

 	// gzip-compressed length
-	require.Equal(t, uint32(79), ci.PackedLength)
+	require.Equal(t, 75, int(ci.PackedLength), "packed length")
 	require.Equal(t, uint32(len(compressibleData)), ci.OriginalLength)
 	require.Equal(t, headerID, ci.CompressionHeaderID)

